# Git Workflow (Team)

Production branch: `main`. Japanese human-facing sources of truth:

- `docs/rules/git-branch.md`
- `docs/rules/git-commit-message.md`
- `docs/rules/git-pull-request.md`

Commit message: `<type>: <subject>` (Japanese subject, present tense, max 50 chars). Types: feat / fix / chore / refactor / test / hotfix.
